- How would you adapt this to Redis streams for invalidation propagation?
- How would you measure stampede risk and tune TTLs accordingly?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests design of robust, multi-tenant cache invalidation with Redis and Memcached, covering versioning, streams, stampede protection, and testability.

## Key Concepts
